Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: fuse3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/SpliceFS/client
Description: client of the SpliceFS read-only multi-source filesystem
 splicefs mounts a read-only folder whose files are streamed from several
 SpliceFS servers at once. Every server that holds a copy of a file serves
 blocks of it, and the client puts them back together and caches them on
 local disk.
